{"text": "Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc. — Human Resources — CONFIDENTIAL PERSONNEL RECORD\n\nHalberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc.\n4400 South Hydraulic Avenue, Wichita, Kansas 67216\nNovember 7, 2025\nHand-delivered and by certified mail\nRosendo Villalpando\n1729 N. Minneola St.\nWichita, KS 67203\nEmployee no. HAF-06617\nDear Mr. Villalpando:\nThis letter confirms that your employment with Halberd as a Route Driver ends effective today, 11/07/2025.\nReason\nOn October 29 you were involved in a collision in the company yard while driving truck no. 14. Under Section 6.3 of the handbook and 49 CFR Part 40 you were sent for post-accident testing. The medical review officer reported a verified positive result for amphetamines on November 4. You told Marvin Oglesby, your supervisor, that you take a prescription for ADHD; the MRO did not receive documentation of a valid prescription within the time allowed. A positive result is a terminable offense for safety-sensitive positions.\nFinal pay\nWages through today: $1,286.40 gross, paid on the regular payday, November 14, as required by K.S.A. 44-315.\nAccrued vacation, 46.5 hours at $26.80: $1,246.20.\nLess the balance of your uniform account: ($88.00).\nDirect deposit will go to the account on file ending 8852. Your Form W-2 will be mailed in January to the address above.\nBenefits\nMedical and dental coverage ends 11/30/25. Wheatland Benefit Administrators will send your COBRA notice; your member ID is FH-774120-01. Your account with the Chisholm Trail 401(k) Trust (participant no. P-0044187) is fully vested; the outstanding loan balance of $3,412.77 becomes due.\nCompany property to return by November 12\nItem\tIdentifier\nLaptop, Dell Latitude\tService tag 7HK2QW3\nPhone, iPhone 13\tIMEI 356979695221510\nAccess badge\tNo. 00418-B\nFuel card\tending 4417\nTruck no. 14 keys\t2022 Ford F-250, VIN 1FT7W2BT4NEC41877, tag KS 447 PLM\n\nYour network account (rvillalpando) was disabled at 8:00 this morning.\nOther\nYou remain bound by the confidentiality agreement you signed on June 3, 2019. We will confirm only dates of employment and job title to prospective employers. We will not contest a claim for unemployment benefits, but we will report the reason for separation truthfully if asked.\nQuestions may be directed to me at 316-555-0128 or kstang@halberdfasteners.example.\nSincerely,\nKimberly Stang, Director of Human Resources\ncc: personnel file; M. Oglesby", "kind": "Word document", "detail": "367 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Rosendo Villalpando", "Marvin Oglesby", "rvillalpando", "Kimberly Stang", "M. Oglesby"], "companies": ["Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc.", "Halberd", "Wheatland Benefit Administrators", "Chisholm Trail 401(k) Trust", "Dell", "iPhone", "Ford", "halberdfasteners"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Wichita", "Kansas", "Halberdfasteners"], "health": ["amphetamine", "ADHD"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Rosendo", "Marvin", "Kimberly"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.9000000059604645, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 33, "text": "Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc."}, {"start": 85, "end": 118, "text": "Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Halberd Aerospace Fasteners, Inc."}, {"start": 119, "end": 146, "text": "4400 South Hydraulic Avenue", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "4400 South Hydraulic Avenue"}, {"start": 148, "end": 155, "text": "Wichita",